+// deletion. A generation-leading composite key cannot seek node_rowid alone;
+// partial indexes limited to primary graphs or building attempts omit children
+// that still participate in foreign-key enforcement. Keep the repair names so
+// manually maintained stores gain no duplicate indexes when upgraded.
